flowchart TB
Company[Public company frontend] --> Public[Public proxy paths only]
Portal[Authenticated Portal frontend] --> Private[Session CSRF and roles]
Public --> API[Fastify published content API]
Private --> API
API --> PG[Portal PostgreSQL]
API --> Files[Private object storage]
API --> Queue[Durable bounded outboxes]
Queue --> Worker[Worker deployment unqualified]
Worker --> Mail[Provider accepted is not delivered]
Worker --> Files
